WeFit modifications: fixed garment-independent instruction embeddings encoded
once with the pinned encoder; exact export/round-trip verification; no text
encoder at runtime; materialized reference K/V views; serialized worker-owned
inference; pure cached-block compilation; neutral source-clothing conditioning;
clothing-region rendering
with full-frame fallback; source-photo compositing and pose-failure checks.
Optional float16 module arithmetic is an inference experiment, not training.
All transformer layers and the native VAE are retained. No model fine-tuning,
new foundation model, reproduction of paper accuracy or universal fit guarantee
is claimed.

